oug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12-e2","summary":"Lavinia shows Jace that victims of petrification were found in Rozlad Square arranged to spell his name.","participants":["lavinia","jace-beleren"],"location":"chamber-of-the-guildpact","importance":"major","page":"stories/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","order":24,"story_date":"2014-03-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":27,"quote":"They spell out your name.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=They%20spell%20out%20your%20name.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Gorgon and the Guildpact","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Doug Beyer"],"date":"2014-03-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=They%20spell%20out%20your%20name.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Gorgon and the Guildpact\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12-e3","summary":"Jace recognizes that the victims' names match planes, realizes a planeswalker is targeting him, and insists on going alone to Rozlad Square.","participants":["jace-beleren","lavinia"],"location":"chamber-of-the-guildpact","importance":"major","page":"stories/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","order":24,"story_date":"2014-03-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":46,"quote":"Clear out all your officers and mages from Rozlad Square. I'm going alone.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=Clear%20out%20all%20your,Square.%20I%27m%20going%20alone.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Gorgon and the Guildpact","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Doug Beyer"